      "teardownNote": "Puts the app back in the icon's yellow and on Box highlight, which is what every export after this shot is made in: scroll to the controls and tap the yellow swatch, scroll back up and tap the first tile, Done. Two earlier cuts of this teardown left the whole app red and the dictionary and saving shots had to be taken again: the first tapped the tile at the scrolled position, where that same y is the swatch row; the second scrolled up with a swipe that started on the sheet's title, outside the scroll view, so it never scrolled and the tap landed on the red swatch again. The swipe now starts inside the grid. Check the end frame before trusting it."
